Licence notes for overchoice-review-media

1. Scripts, data and logos (CC0 1.0)

   scripts/, .github/, catalog.json, playlist.m3u, guide.xml and art/logos/ are dedicated to
   the public domain under Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal:
   https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

2. Linked films and streams

   This repository hosts no film files. The films, episodes and live test streams listed in
   playlist.m3u are not part of it: they are played from their publishers' hosts
   (download.blender.org, archive.org and the test-stream operators listed in README.md),
   under the licences and terms given there. README.md credits the films and their licences.
